SUMMARY:ALI
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:Ali is a three-piece musical project originating from Jakarta I
 ndonesia. Initiated by Arswandaru and John Paul Patton\, the desire of Ali
  is to incorporate Middle Eastern culture with elements 70’s Indonesian 
 psychedelic funk\, cinematic soul\, afro beat\, and disco to create a new 
 groove and sound to the contemporary and vibrant Indonesian music scene. W
 ith all lyrics written in Arabic\, Ali builds on the influence of Middle E
 astern art and music\, which over centuries has assimilated itself deep in
 to Indonesian culture and way of life. Also as the cultural heritage of Ar
 swandaru as an Indonesian – Arab mixed to implement the Arabic lyrics.\n
