 in the city of Cali\, Colombia. Their repertoire spans Afro-Caribbean rhyt
 hms such as Salsa\, as well as music from Colombia’s Pacific region. In 
 their compositions\, Las Guaracheras place a strong emphasis on gender per
 spective and on the recognition and empowerment of women’s roles in the 
 music industry - particularly within Colombia’s Latin Music scene. Throu
 gh their lyrics\, they convey a manifesto of female power and resilience.\
